#: ../developer/accounting.md:1
msgid "Accounting Currency"
msgstr "记账币种"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:3
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps its ledger in USD by default. A deployment can keep it "
"in CNY instead: model prices, usage charges and user quotas are then "
"counted in CNY. Each deployment has exactly one ledger currency. It is "
"chosen by an offline, audited migration and cannot be changed afterwards;"
" it is not a display preference, and neither editing the site "
"configuration nor restarting the gateway changes it."
msgstr ""
"网关默认用 USD 记账。部署也可以改用 CNY 记账：模型价格、用量费用和用户额度都按 CNY "
"计算。每个部署只有一种记账币种，由一次离线、可审计的迁移选定，之后不能再改；它不是显示偏好，修改站点配置或重启网关都不会改变它。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:5
msgid ""
"A deployment that never runs the migration is unaffected: it charges, "
"rounds, admits and refuses exactly as before this feature existed, and "
"its APIs answer with exactly the same fields."
msgstr "从未执行迁移的部署不受影响：计费、舍入、准入和拒绝都与此功能出现之前完全一致，API 返回的字段也完全相同。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:7
msgid "The rules every amount follows"
msgstr "所有金额遵循的规则"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:9
msgid ""
"`serving.accounting.AccountingPolicy` is the single place that knows how "
"the ledger currency changes the arithmetic. Business code asks the "
"policy; it never compares currency codes."
msgstr ""
"`serving.accounting.AccountingPolicy` "
"是唯一知道记账币种如何影响计算的地方。业务代码只询问策略，从不比较币种代码。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "USD ledger (default)"
msgstr "USD 账本（默认）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "CNY ledger"
msgstr "CNY 账本"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Record of the ledger"
msgstr "账本的权威记录"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the `*_usd` columns, as always"
msgstr "`*_usd` 列，与以往相同"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the native `*_amount` columns (`NUMERIC(24, 12)`)"
msgstr "原币 `*_amount` 列（`NUMERIC(24, 12)`）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`*_usd` columns"
msgstr "`*_usd` 列"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the ledger itself"
msgstr "即账本本身"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid ""
"USD equivalents at the fixed policy rate, kept by the "
"`accounting_sync_amounts` triggers"
msgstr "按固定策略汇率得出的美元等值，由 `accounting_sync_amounts` 触发器维护"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Arithmetic of a charge, a gate and a reservation"
msgstr "费用、额度检查和预留的计算方式"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "binary floats, unchanged"
msgstr "二进制浮点数，与以往相同"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "exact decimals of the configured prices"
msgstr "按所配置价格的精确十进制数计算"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "One counter or reservation increment rounds to"
msgstr "每次计数器或预留增量舍入到"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`0.000001` (half away from zero)"
msgstr "`0.000001`（四舍五入，远离零）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`0.000000000001` (half away from zero)"
msgstr "`0.000000000001`（四舍五入，远离零）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Request log `cost_usd`"
msgstr "请求日志 `cost_usd`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`DECIMAL(12, 8)`, unchanged"
msgstr "`DECIMAL(12, 8)`，与以往相同"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the USD equivalent of `cost_amount`"
msgstr "`cost_amount` 的美元等值"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Flat estimate, reservation ceiling, per-request ceiling"
msgstr "固定预估、预留上限、单次请求上限"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "`0.01`, `5`, `1000` USD"
msgstr "`0.01`、`5`、`1000` USD"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "the same USD constants at the fixed rate"
msgstr "相同的 USD 常量按固定汇率换算"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:20
msgid ""
"A request's cost is computed once from its prices and its usage, and "
"rounded only where it is counted. On a CNY ledger a price far below a "
"cent per token accumulates exactly: twelve decimal places hold a ten-"
"thousandth of a fen per million tokens. A CNY amount is never converted "
"to USD and back. The `*_usd` equivalents are derived from it, one way, "
"for USD contracts only."
msgstr ""
"请求费用由价格和用量一次算出，只在计入账本时舍入。在 CNY 账本中，远低于一分钱的 token 单价也能精确累计：十二位小数足以表示每百万 "
"token 万分之一分。CNY 金额从不换成美元再换回来；`*_usd` 等值只为 USD 约定单向推导。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:22
msgid ""
"The rate (`usd_to_currency_rate`, CNY per USD) is fixed when the ledger "
"is migrated, with the date and source the operator recorded. It is not a "
"live exchange rate. An amount once recorded keeps its value: nothing re-"
"reads history at another rate."
msgstr "汇率（`usd_to_currency_rate`，即每美元兑多少人民币）在迁移账本时确定，并记录操作员提供的日期和来源。它不是实时汇率。金额一经记录就保持不变，不会按其他汇率重新解读历史。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:24
msgid "Model price currency"
msgstr "模型报价币种"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:26
msgid ""
"`pricing_currency` declares the currency of a model's or a route's "
"`pricing` and `pricing_schedule`; it defaults to `USD`. Token prices are "
"per million tokens, `request` per request and `image` per image."
msgstr ""
"`pricing_currency` 声明模型或路由的 `pricing` 与 `pricing_schedule` 所用的币种，默认为 "
"`USD`。token 价格按每百万 token 计，`request` 按每次请求计，`image` 按每张图片计。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:28
msgid "A price in the ledger currency is charged as written."
msgstr "与账本币种相同的报价按原样计费。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:29
msgid "A USD price on a CNY ledger is converted once, at the fixed rate."
msgstr "CNY 账本中的 USD 报价按固定汇率换算一次。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:30
msgid ""
"Any other combination, such as a CNY price on a USD ledger, is refused: "
"there is no declared rate for it."
msgstr "其他组合（例如 USD 账本中的 CNY 报价）会被拒绝，因为没有为其声明汇率。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:32
msgid ""
"Automatic DeepSeek prices follow the ledger: a USD ledger reads the "
"[official English pricing page](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/) and a CNY ledger the [official "
"Chinese pricing page](https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-"
"cn/quick_start/pricing/), each in its own currency and never converted "
"from the other. Snapshots are stored by currency, and a snapshot in "
"another currency than the ledger's is refused. See [Automatic DeepSeek "
"prices](adding-models.md#automatic-deepseek-prices)."
msgstr ""
"DeepSeek 自动价格跟随账本币种：USD 账本读取[英文官方价格页](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing/)，CNY 账本读取[中文官方价格页](https://api-"
"docs.deepseek.com/zh-"
"cn/quick_start/pricing/)，各自按原币读取，从不由另一种换算而来。快照按币种分别保存，币种与账本不一致的快照会被拒绝。参见[DeepSeek"
" 自动价格](adding-models.md#automatic-deepseek-prices)。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:34
msgid "API contracts"
msgstr "API 约定"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:36
msgid "Every existing `*_usd` field keeps its USD meaning in every deployment."
msgstr "在任何部署中，现有的每个 `*_usd` 字段都保持美元含义。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:38
msgid ""
"**USD ledger.** Responses keep exactly their fields: no `currency` and no"
" native amounts are added. The one addition is two headers on a budget "
"refusal (429): `X-Accounting-Currency: USD` and `X-RateLimit-Cost-"
"Currency: USD`, which state the unit of the `X-RateLimit-*-Cost` headers."
msgstr ""
"**USD 账本。** 响应字段保持不变：不新增 `currency`，也不新增原币金额。唯一的新增是额度拒绝（429）时的两个响应头：`X"
"-Accounting-Currency: USD` 和 `X-RateLimit-Cost-Currency: USD`，用于说明 "
"`X-RateLimit-*-Cost` 响应头的单位。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:39
msgid ""
"**CNY ledger.** Responses add native amounts beside their USD fields, "
"with `currency`: `cost`, `quota`, `spent`, `remaining`, `daily_limit`, "
"`budget_daily`, `usage_today` and the like, as exact decimals. The "
"`*_usd` fields carry the USD equivalents. The model catalog adds `prices`"
" and `currency`; its `pricing` stays USD."
msgstr ""
"**CNY 账本。** 响应在美元字段旁边增加原币金额及 "
"`currency`：`cost`、`quota`、`spent`、`remaining`、`daily_limit`、`budget_daily`、`usage_today`"
" 等，均为精确十进制数。`*_usd` 字段返回美元等值。模型目录增加 `prices` 和 `currency`；其 `pricing` 仍为 "
"USD。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:40
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Writes.** A native amount is sent with the ledger `currency`, for "
"example `{\"budget_daily\": \"50\", \"currency\": \"CNY\"}`; the legacy "
"`budget_daily_usd` still means USD. Sending a currency other than the "
"ledger's, or both a native amount and its USD alias, is refused. A native"
" write is stored exactly, and its USD equivalent beside it."
msgstr ""
"**写入。** 原币金额需与账本 `currency` 一起提交，例如 `{\"budget_daily\": \"50\", "
"\"currency\": \"CNY\"}`；旧的 `budget_daily_usd` "
"仍表示美元。提交与账本不同的币种，或同时提交原币金额及其美元别名，都会被拒绝。原币写入按原值精确保存，并在旁边保存其美元等值。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:42
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"USD-only contracts stay USD: the OpenAI-compatible billing endpoints "
"(`/v1/usage`, `/v1/dashboard/billing/*`), `/internal/agent-"
"grants/{id}/usage` (`spent_usd`), batch `cost_usd` totals, "
"`upstream_cost_usd`, RouteWise budgets and diagnostics, and the "
"`X-RateLimit-*-Cost` headers. On a CNY ledger they report USD "
"equivalents, so clients such as new-api, one-api, sub2api and the cloud "
"agent keep working unchanged. Provider balances and quotas keep the units"
" their provider reports."
msgstr ""
"仅限美元的约定继续使用美元：OpenAI "
"兼容的计费接口（`/v1/usage`、`/v1/dashboard/billing/*`）、`/internal/agent-"
"grants/{id}/usage`（`spent_usd`）、批处理 `cost_usd` "
"汇总、`upstream_cost_usd`、RouteWise 预算与诊断，以及 `X-RateLimit-*-Cost` 响应头。在 CNY "
"账本中它们返回美元等值，因此 new-api、one-api、sub2api 和云端 agent 等客户端无需改动即可继续使用。Provider "
"余额和额度保留 provider 返回的单位。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:44
msgid ""
"The role default quotas (`user_daily_quota_<role>`) are runtime settings "
"stored in USD. On a CNY ledger Admin shows and accepts them in CNY, and "
"the stored value is the USD equivalent of what was entered."
msgstr ""
"角色默认额度（`user_daily_quota_<role>`）是以 USD 保存的运行时设置。在 CNY 账本中，管理后台以 CNY "
"显示和接收它们，保存的是所输入金额的美元等值。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:46
msgid ""
"`GET /site-config` reports `accounting.currency` so the console can "
"format amounts. The console displays the amounts the API supplies; it "
"never applies a rate of its own, and it never shows a USD value "
"relabelled as CNY."
msgstr ""
"`GET /site-config` 返回 `accounting.currency`，供控制台格式化金额。控制台只显示 API "
"给出的金额，从不自行换汇，也不会把美元值改标为人民币显示。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:48
msgid "Every way a request is charged"
msgstr "请求的所有计费入口"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:50
msgid ""
"Chat completions, streaming and non-streaming, the Responses API, "
"Anthropic `/v1/messages`, embeddings, the console's web chat "
"(playground), batches, inference grants and requests on behalf of another"
" user are all charged at one billing point, in the ledger currency, "
"through the same spend ledger:"
msgstr ""
"聊天补全（流式与非流式）、Responses API、Anthropic "
"`/v1/messages`、embeddings、控制台网页聊天（playground）、批处理、推理授权，以及代其他用户发起的请求，都在同一个计费点、以账本币种、通过同一个费用账本计费："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:52
msgid ""
"**Admission.** The request is checked against the API key's budgets, then"
" its project's, then the account's daily and monthly quotas, and reserves"
" an estimate (between the flat minimum and the reservation ceiling). On a"
" CNY ledger every one of these comparisons is between native amounts."
msgstr ""
"**准入。** 请求依次接受 API Key 预算、所属项目预算、账户日额度和月额度的检查，并预留一个预估金额（介于固定下限和预留上限之间）。在 "
"CNY 账本中，这些比较都在原币金额之间进行。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:53
msgid ""
"**Charge.** The finished request's cost is recorded in the ledger and "
"written to the account, key and project counters."
msgstr "**计费。** 请求结束后的费用记入账本，并写入账户、Key 和项目计数器。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:54
msgid ""
"**Failure and cancellation.** These are charged exactly as before: what "
"the billing point recorded, and nothing for a request that produced no "
"billable usage."
msgstr "**失败与取消。** 计费方式与以往完全相同：按计费点记录的金额计费；没有产生可计费用量的请求不收费。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:56
msgid "Shared accounting and draining"
msgstr "共享记账与排空"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:58
msgid ""
"The local (per-process) and the shared accounting follow the same rules. "
"In the shared mode, reservations and reconciliations are kept in "
"`spend_reservations.amount` and `spend_reconciliations.amount`, in the "
"ledger currency, beside their USD equivalents. A settlement's digest "
"includes the currency and the rate, so a batch resent after its answer "
"was lost can never be counted in another unit. A log row records the "
"currency of its charge (`metadata.spend_currency`), and a crash "
"reconciliation refuses rows recorded in another currency."
msgstr ""
"本地（单进程）记账和共享记账遵循相同规则。在共享模式下，预留和对账记录保存在 `spend_reservations.amount` 与 "
"`spend_reconciliations.amount` "
"中，以账本币种计，旁边是美元等值。结算摘要包含币种和汇率，因此应答丢失后重发的批次绝不会按另一种单位计数。日志行记录其费用的币种（`metadata.spend_currency`），崩溃恢复对账会拒绝以其他币种记录的行。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:60
msgid ""
"Each process reports its accounting in its `config_instances` "
"capabilities and in its handoff status: protocol `2`, the mode, the "
"currency and the rate. `python -m serving.shared_spend status` lists as "
"`unsupported` every process that reports an older protocol, or another "
"currency or rate (`other_policy`): processes that cannot keep the same "
"ledger must not take part in it, whatever mode they report. A process "
"that still holds a cost not known to be written, in either mode, cannot "
"be sealed for a handoff."
msgstr ""
"每个进程在 `config_instances` 能力和排空（handoff）状态中报告其记账方式：协议版本 "
"`2`、模式、币种和汇率。`python -m serving.shared_spend status` "
"会把协议版本较旧、或币种/汇率不同（`other_policy`）的进程列为 "
"`unsupported`：无法维护同一本账的进程，无论声称处于哪种模式，都不能参与。无论哪种模式，仍持有未确认入账费用的进程都不能在交接时封口。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:62
msgid "Migrating a ledger"
msgstr "迁移账本"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:64
msgid "An existing USD database"
msgstr "已有的 USD 数据库"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:66
msgid ""
"`python -m migrations upgrade` with this release applies "
"`0022_ledger_currency`. It only adds the native columns, their triggers, "
"the dashboard rollup's native sum and the migration audit table; it "
"converts nothing. The previous release keeps running on the upgraded "
"schema, and its writes get their native amounts from the triggers. The "
"database stays a USD ledger until an operator migrates it."
msgstr ""
"使用本版本执行 `python -m migrations upgrade` 会应用 "
"`0022_ledger_currency`。它只新增原币列、对应触发器、看板汇总的原币合计和迁移审计表，不换算任何金额。上一版本可以继续在升级后的库结构上运行，它的写入由触发器补齐原币金额。在操作员执行迁移之前，数据库始终是"
" USD 账本。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:68
msgid "A new deployment"
msgstr "新部署"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:70
msgid ""
"Run the schema migrations as for any deployment. A new USD deployment "
"needs nothing more. A new CNY deployment runs the currency migration "
"below before it serves traffic. With no usage there is nothing to "
"convert, but the policy, its completion marker and the audit record are "
"written in the same way."
msgstr ""
"与任何部署一样执行库结构迁移。新的 USD 部署无需其他操作。新的 CNY "
"部署在承接流量之前执行下面的币种迁移。没有用量时没有需要换算的金额，但策略、完成标记和审计记录同样会写入。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:72
msgid "Moving a ledger to CNY"
msgstr "将账本迁移为 CNY"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:74
msgid ""
"The currency migration is `ops/accounting_currency.py`. It issues no DDL "
"and refuses `--apply` unless:"
msgstr "币种迁移工具是 `ops/accounting_currency.py`。它不执行 DDL，并且只有满足以下条件才会执行 `--apply`："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:76
msgid ""
"the schema is at this release's head and has the native columns, triggers"
" and audit table;"
msgstr "库结构处于本版本的最新版本，并已具备原币列、触发器和审计表；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:77
msgid "no other client is connected to the database;"
msgstr "没有其他客户端连接数据库；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:78
msgid ""
"the shared accounting is in its `local` mode, with no shared "
"reservations, settlements or reconciliations."
msgstr "共享记账处于 `local` 模式，且没有共享预留、结算或对账记录。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:80
msgid ""
"CNY requires a positive `--usd-to-currency-rate` (CNY per USD), an ISO "
"`--rate-date` and a nonempty `--rate-source`. The command does not fetch "
"a rate."
msgstr ""
"CNY 需要正数的 `--usd-to-currency-rate`（每美元兑多少人民币）、ISO 格式的 `--rate-date` 和非空的 "
"`--rate-source`。该命令不会自行获取汇率。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:82
msgid "Before the maintenance window:"
msgstr "维护窗口之前："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:84
msgid "Choose and record the rate."
msgstr "选定并记录汇率。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:85
msgid "Take a database backup and test the restore."
msgstr "备份数据库并演练恢复。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:86
msgid "Keep the previous deployment configuration."
msgstr "保留上一版本的部署配置。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:88
msgid "During the window:"
msgstr "维护窗口期间："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:90
msgid "Stop incoming traffic and drain in-flight requests."
msgstr "停止接入流量，并排空进行中的请求。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:91
msgid ""
"Stop every gateway worker, rollup, scheduled job, maintenance process, "
"database console and backup connection, and disable automatic restarts. "
"The command refuses to apply while another client is connected; it "
"terminates nobody, and it cannot stop a scheduler from starting a new "
"client afterwards."
msgstr "停止所有网关进程、汇总任务、定时任务、维护进程、数据库控制台和备份连接，并关闭自动重启。仍有其他客户端连接时，命令拒绝执行；它不会终止任何连接，也无法阻止调度器之后启动新的客户端。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:93
msgid "Then preview, from the repository root:"
msgstr "然后在仓库根目录预览："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:103
msgid ""
"The preview is read-only. It shows the previous and target policies and, "
"for each monetary column, the row counts, the original USD total and the "
"proposed native total. Logs and their rollups describe overlapping usage;"
" reconcile each table on its own."
msgstr "预览是只读的。它显示原策略和目标策略，以及每个金额列的行数、原始美元合计和拟换算的原币合计。日志和日志汇总描述的是重叠的用量，应逐表核对。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:105
msgid "Run the same command with `--apply`. In one serializable transaction it:"
msgstr "用 `--apply` 再次运行同一命令。它在一个可串行化事务中："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:107
msgid "fills the native amounts of every monetary table at the rate;"
msgstr "按汇率填写所有金额表的原币金额；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:108
msgid ""
"records the policy and a completion marker in `site_settings` "
"(`accounting:policy`, `accounting:migration`);"
msgstr "在 `site_settings` 中记录策略和完成标记（`accounting:policy`、`accounting:migration`）；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:109
msgid "writes an audit row to `accounting_currency_migrations`;"
msgstr "向 `accounting_currency_migrations` 写入一条审计记录；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:110
msgid "raises the schema's compatibility floor to `0022_ledger_currency`."
msgstr "将库结构的兼容下限提高到 `0022_ledger_currency`。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:112
msgid ""
"Keep the JSON result and confirm `applied` and `migration_complete` are "
"true. The `*_usd` values are left as they were. Repeating the exact "
"completed policy returns `already_applied` and changes nothing: no amount"
" is converted twice and the floor is not touched. Any other policy, a "
"different rate included, is refused once a CNY policy is active."
msgstr ""
"保留 JSON 结果，并确认 `applied` 和 `migration_complete` 均为 true。`*_usd` "
"值保持原样。用完全相同的已完成策略重复执行会返回 `already_applied`，不做任何改动：不会二次换算，也不会改动兼容下限。CNY "
"策略生效后，任何其他策略（包括不同汇率）都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:114
msgid ""
"Then declare the currency in `SITE_CONFIGURATION` before the gateway "
"starts:"
msgstr "然后在网关启动前，在 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 中声明币种："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:120
msgid ""
"For example, `python -m serving.config.manage set SITE_CONFIGURATION "
"'<json>'` with the backend image. Startup refuses all of these:"
msgstr ""
"例如使用后端镜像执行 `python -m serving.config.manage set SITE_CONFIGURATION "
"'<json>'`。以下情况启动都会被拒绝："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:122
msgid ""
"a declaration that differs from the ledger's currency (an absent "
"declaration means USD);"
msgstr "声明的币种与账本币种不一致（未声明即视为 USD）；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:123
msgid "an invalid policy, or a CNY policy without its matching completion marker;"
msgstr "策略无效，或 CNY 策略缺少对应的完成标记；"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:124
msgid "a database missing the native columns, triggers or audit table."
msgstr "数据库缺少原币列、触发器或审计表。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:126
msgid ""
"Once the gateway runs, Admin refuses a site configuration whose currency "
"differs from the ledger's. Setting the declaration alone never migrates a"
" database."
msgstr "网关运行后，管理后台会拒绝币种与账本不一致的站点配置。单独修改声明永远不会迁移数据库。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:128
msgid "Before reopening traffic:"
msgstr "重新开放流量之前："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:130
msgid ""
"Check that `/site-config`, the model catalog `prices` and the usage and "
"quota fields carry CNY."
msgstr "确认 `/site-config`、模型目录的 `prices` 以及用量和额度字段都返回 CNY。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:131
msgid ""
"Check a controlled request and a quota change against the ledger and its "
"USD equivalents."
msgstr "用一次受控请求和一次额度修改，对照账本及其美元等值进行核对。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:133
msgid "Compatibility and rollback"
msgstr "兼容性与回滚"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "Images that start on it"
msgstr "可以在其上启动的镜像"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "USD, at `0022_ledger_currency`"
msgstr "USD，处于 `0022_ledger_currency`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "this release and the previous one (the revision only expands the schema)"
msgstr "本版本和上一版本（该迁移只扩展库结构）"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid "CNY, migrated by `ops/accounting_currency.py`"
msgstr "CNY，已由 `ops/accounting_currency.py` 迁移"

#: ../developer/accounting.md
msgid ""
"this release and later ones; older images refuse to start, because the "
"compatibility floor is `0022_ledger_currency`"
msgstr "本版本及之后的版本；更早的镜像会拒绝启动，因为兼容下限为 `0022_ledger_currency`"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:140
msgid ""
"An image older than `0022_ledger_currency` knows only a USD ledger. It "
"would charge a CNY tariff as dollars, which is why the migration shuts it"
" out. A failed `--apply` rolls back its transaction: keep services "
"stopped, correct the cause, and run it again with the same approved "
"inputs. An applied CNY policy cannot be converted back in place or given "
"another rate. Going back means stopping every client, restoring the pre-"
"migration backup and the matching previous configuration, and accounting "
"for the writes accepted after the backup. Do not simulate a rollback by "
"editing the declaration or the policy rows, or by applying an inverse "
"rate. No schema downgrade is involved: `0022_ledger_currency`'s downgrade"
" keeps every column."
msgstr ""
"早于 `0022_ledger_currency` 的镜像只认识 USD 账本，会把 CNY "
"报价当作美元计费，这正是迁移要把它拦在外面的原因。`--apply` "
"失败时会回滚其事务：保持服务停止，修正原因后用同样经过批准的参数重新执行。已生效的 CNY "
"策略不能原地换回，也不能改用其他汇率。回退的方式是停止所有客户端，恢复迁移前的备份和对应的上一版本配置，并处理备份之后接受的写入。不要通过修改声明或策略记录、或应用反向汇率来模拟回滚。整个过程不涉及库结构降级：`0022_ledger_currency`"
" 的降级会保留所有列。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:142
msgid "Databases built by a distribution"
msgstr "由发行版构建的数据库"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:144
msgid ""
"A distribution may already keep a CNY ledger whose own revisions created "
"these objects, with the same `accounting_sync_amounts` function, the same"
" columns and the same triggers. For such a database:"
msgstr ""
"某个发行版可能已经维护着一个 CNY 账本，其自有迁移已经创建了这些对象：相同的 `accounting_sync_amounts` "
"函数、相同的列和相同的触发器。对于这样的数据库："

#: ../developer/accounting.md:146
msgid ""
"**Keep its released revisions.** Keep the files, ids and parents of its "
"own revisions, so that a database that ran them never runs them again."
msgstr "**保留其已发布的迁移。** 保留其自有迁移的文件、ID 和父版本，使已执行过它们的数据库不会再执行一次。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:147
msgid ""
"**Join its head to `0022_ledger_currency`.** Add one empty merge "
"revision: `down_revision = (\"<distribution head>\", "
"\"0022_ledger_currency\")`, with no upgrade body."
msgstr ""
"**把其最新版本并入 `0022_ledger_currency`。** 新增一个空的合并迁移：`down_revision = "
"(\"<distribution head>\", \"0022_ledger_currency\")`，升级函数为空。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:148
msgid ""
"**Upgrade.** `0022_ledger_currency` then runs on that database as a no-"
"op, except that it replaces the two `account_quotas` and `organizations` "
"bridge functions with its own; their native branch is the one the "
"distribution installed. It reads the function digest, "
"`SYNC_FUNCTION_SHA256`, adds only what is missing, and converts no "
"amount. A CNY database whose shared reservations or reconciliations lack "
"native amounts is refused rather than relabelled."
msgstr ""
"**升级。** 之后 `0022_ledger_currency` 在该数据库上不做任何改动，只会用自己的版本替换 "
"`account_quotas` 与 `organizations` 之间的两个桥接函数，其原币分支与发行版安装的相同。它读取函数摘要 "
"`SYNC_FUNCTION_SHA256`，只补齐缺失的部分，不换算任何金额。共享预留或对账记录缺少原币金额的 CNY "
"数据库会被拒绝，而不会被改标单位。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:149
msgid ""
"**Leave the floor as it is.** The compatibility floor is not raised, so "
"the distribution's previous image keeps starting through its rollback "
"window."
msgstr "**保持兼容下限不变。** 不提高兼容下限，因此发行版的上一版本镜像在其回滚窗口内仍可启动。"

#: ../developer/accounting.md:150
msgid ""
"**Keep the currency declared.** Keep `accounting.currency` in "
"`SITE_CONFIGURATION`."
msgstr "**保持币种声明。** 在 `SITE_CONFIGURATION` 中保留 `accounting.currency`。"
